#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Read and write:</strong> your chats, groups, channels for circles and encrypted guild channels."
msgstr "<strong>Ler e escribir:</strong> Os seus chats, grupos, canles para círculos e canles guildas encriptadas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Read only:</strong> public channels and other guild channels. Their messages go through the site's word filter and rules, so a message written there from an app is removed: write those on this site."
msgstr "<strong>Ler só:</strong> canles públicas e outras canles gremios. As súas mensaxes pasan a través do filtro de palabras e regras do sitio web, polo que se elimina unha mensaxe escrita a partir dunha aplicación: escribe as palabras neste sitio."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Site bot</strong>: free feeds only. Once approved it is the site's: the admins run it and it is not linked to you."
msgstr "<strong>Sitio web bot</strong>Alimentos libres só. Unha vez aprobado é o sitio web: os administradores executa-lo e non está conectado a vostede."

